epresentativeness":0.948482871055603,"text_excerpt":"So excited to have a kombucha brewery in NOLA! I've tried several kombucha brands and this is by far the best I've had and now there is a brewery to frequent. =) If you haven't tasted Big Easy Bucha yet, you are missing out! Cheers to a local, health conscious and environmentally responsible company! Who doesn't love that?"},{"business_id":"HDdmmT-aLe5SmFeQu_y2Kw","review_id":"BDUYQMHlE4gDFqyDmj8orw","date":"2017-04-20T19:43:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9416274428367615,"text_excerpt":"Great place & glad to have it here in the Big Easy. I attended the opening night events & it was FANTASTIC. For the GRAND OPENING there were food trucks, lite bites, free sample, discounted items & giveaways. I attended this event & was ecstatic to see the arg amounts of people who enjoyed the taste of kombucha but also the health benefits. Lots of people attended & are excited to see Kombucha locally brewed here in New Orleans. Off in an area that's widely used by other business off Earhart near Broadway; this was the perfect place, perfect night, perfect weather. The facility itself is beautiful, widely spaced & gives off a laissez-faire kinda feel. Large brewing tanks adorn the floor f..."},{"business_id":"HDdmmT-aLe5SmFeQu_y2Kw","review_id":"YDqw0tcLG2mix1ysVroXdA","date":"2016-11-05T17:12:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9363425374031067,"text_excerpt":"Holy kombucha Batman! This is the first local kombucha brewery in New Orleans and it's in my backyard! I was lucky enough to made it to the grand opening last night and had an amazing time!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"HDdmmT-aLe5SmFeQu_y2Kw","photo_id":"0gsJ_DRfbP_YeQA6mkafOw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/0gsJ_DRfbP_YeQA6mkafOw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9200727343559265},{"business_id":"HDdmmT-aLe5SmFeQu_y2Kw","photo_id":"FIw-31zwf-ybVWcaaTFwAw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FIw-31zwf-ybVWcaaTFwAw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0